I'll stick strictly to the requested keys.\n\n    Let's double check the `usable_content` constraint: \"先呈现能区别不同研究的发现或论证，不先套领域常见结论；结尾也要保留这些区别。别把多个不同对象、材料、产品、场景或实验设置的结果合成一个普适机制或结论。\"\n    I will craft it carefully.\n    \"针对肌苷与短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）在人体内的作用证据呈现明显的情境分化。在SCFAs方面，临床队列数据显示粪便中高水平的乙酸、丙酸、丁酸和戊酸与抗PD-1治疗后的更长无进展生存期（PFS）呈正相关，但在抗CTLA-4治疗人群中，高血清丁酸与丙酸水平却与疗效下降相关，提示同一代谢物在不同抗体类型下的效应方向相反。对于肌苷，其促进CD8+ T细胞增殖与功能的机制完全建立在葡萄糖限制条件下的小鼠实体瘤模型之上；人类数据仅停留在理论推测层面，即血浆浓度通常为低微摩尔级，坏死或缺氧微环境中可能积聚至数百微摩尔，但并未在患者样本中实测。综合来看，现有材料仅能提供粪便或血清代谢物的定性趋势与方向性关联，尚未触及肿瘤局部微环境或配对体液的绝对定量维度。各研究均未给出肌苷或SCFAs在人类TME/血清中的具体浓度阈值（μM/ng/mL），也缺乏将这些精确浓度与ICI客观缓解率（ORR）或生存终点进行直接统计绑定的证据，定性关联与定量剂量-效应关系之间存在明确的方法学断层。\"\n    This matches all constraints. Starts with differentiation, ends with the distinction/gap, avoids universal claims, keeps settings separate.\n\n    Check `decision`: `external_research` is correct.\n    Check `quantitative_comparisons`: `[]` is correct per rule.\n    All good.\n\n    One minor thing: The prompt says \"reported_statistics 记录原文给出的统计量（没报告才留空）\". I will add it to the JSON just in case, or assume it's part of the thought process. I'll stick to the exact requested keys. If the system expects it, I might add it, but the prompt explicitly lists the order. I'll follow the order strictly.\n\n    Final check of the prompt: \"返回 JSON，按此顺序写字段：quantitative_comparisons（无数字则 []）, usable_content, decision, still_missing, read_focus, external_ask, reason。\"\n    I will generate exactly that.\n    Ready. \n    Output matches response. \n    Self-Correction/Refinement during thought: \n    I should ensure `quantitative_comparisons` is strictly `[]` as instructed. \n    I will verify the `usable_content` length and tone. It's concise and directly addresses the question's premise vs reality. \n    The `decision` correctly identifies `external_research`. \n    `still_missing`, `read_focus`, `external_ask` are tightly scoped to the gap. \n    `reason` explains why current materials fail the success criteria. \n    All constr